WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Step 1. Start with recorded installations, named products, endpoints and version evidence.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Step 1. One endpoint can have many installations; these totals describe different things.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Step 2. Open Concentration and review the leading products.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Step 2. The three-product share uses all installations as its denominator, including unnamed records.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
Step 3. Open Version variation and choose a product with multiple recorded versions.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:39.000
Step 3. The filtered explorer lets you compare versions, paths, sources and host devices.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Step 4. Read Evidence priorities to choose a collection or verification task.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:52.000
Step 4. These gaps overlap. Follow a review link to inspect the affected records.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.500
Step 5. Export the filtered evidence to Excel for follow-up with the software owner.

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:05.000
Step 5. Return to the briefing and Generate PDF to share the scoped summary.
